Z||000000||DXR_DAD||05-09-2000||08:36 PM||||Well this is to clear up some of the bad press the fourm got about doing business with fourm members.  I just did a little business with two members, we had not done any before this!! I want to sell they wanted to buy. I sent the stuff, they sent the $$ It was that easy. I did not wait until I got the money, It's just a trust thing, you feel me!! This is the way I do things, and these guys did not know if I was going to rip them of, so the trust must go both was. Now I have done business with other members and have had NO problems AT ALL!<P>THANKS:<BR>DaRkLoRD<BR>sully5<BR>SuperX<BR>mbackus<BR>Tom<BR>Fiero Shop<BR>Oreif<BR>And anyone that I forgot..you too<P>I think we need more post like this. Kinda like that ebay feed back thing.<BR>Thanks||||reg||14
