Z||000006||batboy||05-09-2000||11:06 PM||||The only Fiero guy I can say that I've been unhappy with is Chris West, but we finally got the situation resolved and I got what I paid for...finally.<P>Well, I guess was also disappointed that Mr. Mike's floor mats didn't match the original ones as well as I was led to believe. I'm not knocking his other stuff. His seat covers are excellent, he is quick at shipping, and calls to let you know when it was shipped. But, he told me that he farms out the floor mats. They are much cheaper than most others though.<P>I'm satisfied with the products and/or services from the Fiero Store, Rodney Dickman, RCC, FOCOA, Super X, Dan-O, Cooter, Phil, Bruce, BHooper, Monkeyman, and probably several other members that I'm forgetting right now because I'm tired.||||reg||1
