Z||000015||BlackGT||05-10-2000||03:13 PM||||I`ve done business with folks on the net as<BR>well as thru the mail....haven`t had a problem with anyone. In fact most of the folks I`ve had the opportunity to have contact with have been some of the greatest<BR>folks walking the planet. We all share a common love/addiction and I have no problem sharing whatever I have whether it be parts,<BR>advice..whatever! For someone to stoop so low as to rip off another enthusiast is cruel<BR>and the world is a round place what comes around goes around. I treat folks like I want<BR>to be treated so I get that in return....it<BR>works for me!||||reg||6
